#: bal/gui/qt/report_pages.py:464
msgid "No will-executor holds your will: you keep the signed transaction yourself (backup transaction). Nobody will broadcast it for you: after the delivery date it must be broadcast by you or by someone you gave it to."
msgstr "Nessun will-executor custodisce il tuo testamento: la transazione firmata la conservi tu (transazione di backup). Nessuno la trasmetterà al posto tuo: dopo la data di consegna devi trasmetterla tu, o la persona a cui l'hai affidata."

#: bal/gui/qt/report_pages.py:684 bal/gui/qt/report_pages.py:687
msgid "HOW IT WORKS"
msgstr "COME FUNZIONA"

#: bal/gui/qt/report_pages.py:717
msgid "PRIVATE — keep it in a safe place"
